   "part": 1,
   "pin": null,
   "question": "Has the batch size been optimized with benchmarks or is that planned, possibly per-index?",
   "quote": "Has this been optimized with benchmarks or are you planning to do that? This might be something differs between the indexes so it might make sense to let each index define their own value.",
   "request": "",
   "status": "accepted",
   "status_by": {
    "at": "2026-03-14",
    "by": "fjahr",
    "id": "rc:2935249122",
    "quote": "the benchmarks have been run now and quite extensively and I haven't seen any penalty from this change. I think the follow-up that tweaks the value... if that is the case then I don't think my comment should be considered a blocker."
   },
   "status_note": "author replied in rc:2759584026 to handle in follow-up; fjahr accepted in rc:2935249122 noting benchmark results showed no penalty",
